{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/b77847e4652de45eec072f9ae7795f8e.poster.avif?t=1772710307\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/b77847e4652de45eec072f9ae7795f8e.webm?t=1772710307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/b77847e4652de45eec072f9ae7795f8e.mp4?t=1772710307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What can you expect from this adventure?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights</strong>: Face false gods that are both prisoners and jailers. Uncover their stories and break their chains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Souls-like Progression</strong>: Learn from every death as you grow stronger, guided by Bastet.\u00a0Use your trusted sword, Daedalus to gather stardust and grow in power! The more you parry, the stronger Daedalus becomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/a38681585a7c755519e704d75ed2909b.poster.avif?t=1772710307\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/a38681585a7c755519e704d75ed2909b.webm?t=1772710307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/a38681585a7c755519e704d75ed2909b.mp4?t=1772710307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lore-Rich World</strong>: Uncover hidden truths in cryptic murals, echoing voices, and twisted mazes.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Platformer</strong>: Precision-based movements, where you have to use Icarus' Wings to your advantage!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WISHLIST NOW!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive the trials and discover the truth about the origins, or will you fall to the shadows lurking in the desert\u00a0and\u00a0beyond?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/5e706e088b543260ce091aaec76da0cd.poster.avif?t=1772710307\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/5e706e088b543260ce091aaec76da0cd.webm?t=1772710307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/extras/5e706e088b543260ce091aaec76da0cd.mp4?t=1772710307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891970?t=1772710307","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2891970?t=1772710307","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/3a987a1d113305e4ea92ae7049838d6e8d4f28d2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772710307","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891970/3a987a1d113305e4ea92ae7049838d6e8d4f28d2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772710307","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4182730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.ste